},[129,131,134,137,140,143,146,149],{"depth":12,"slug":130,"text":117},"execution-api",{"depth":25,"slug":132,"text":133},"execute-function-public","Execute Function (Public)",{"depth":25,"slug":135,"text":136},"execute-function-authenticated","Execute Function (Authenticated)",{"depth":25,"slug":138,"text":139},"get-execution-result","Get Execution Result",{"depth":25,"slug":141,"text":142},"testing-in-the-playground","Testing in the Playground",{"depth":25,"slug":144,"text":145},"response-format","Response Format",{"depth":25,"slug":147,"text":148},"execution-status","Execution Status",{"depth":25,"slug":108,"text":109},[],[],{"title":117,"description":118},[],"api/functions",{"id":154,"data":156,"body":162,"filePath":163,"digest":164,"rendered":165},{"title":157,"description":158,"editUrl":8,"head":159,"template":10,"sidebar":160,"pagefind":8,"draft":13},"Functions API","Manage serverless functions via API",[],{"hidden":13,"attrs":161},{},"# Functions API\n\nCreate, deploy, and manage serverless functions programmatically.\n\n## List Functions\n\n```http\nGET /v1/functions\n```\n\n## Get Function\n\n```http\nGET /v1/functions/{id}\n```\n\n## Create Function\n\n```http\nPOST /v1/functions\nContent-Type: application/json\n\n{\n  \"name\": \"my-function\",\n  \"runtime\": \"python\",\n  \"code\": \"def main(request): return {'status': 'ok'}\"\n}\n```\n\n## Update Function\n\n```http\nPATCH /v1/functions/{id}\nContent-Type: application/json\n\n{\n  \"name\": \"updated-name\",\n  \"code\": \"...\"\n}\n```\n\n## Delete Function\n\n```http\nDELETE /v1/functions/{id}\n```\n\n## Deploy Function\n\n```http\nPOST /v1/functions/{id}/deploy\n```\n\n## Get Function Stats\n\n```http\nGET /v1/functions/{id}/stats\n```\n\n## Response Format\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"fn_123456\",\n  \"name\": \"my-function\",\n  \"runtime\": \"python\",\n  \"status\": \"active\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2024-01-01T00:00:00Z\"\n}\n```\n\n## Try It Out\n\nUse the [Function Playground](/guides/playground/) to test any function directly from the browser without writing code.","src/content/docs/api/functions.md","287ade0313ba4bc0",{"html":166,"metadata":167},"\u003Cdiv class=\"sl-heading-wrapper level-h1\">\u003Ch1 id=\"functions-api\">Functions API\u003C/h1>\u003Ca class=\"sl-anchor-link\" href=\"#functions-api\">\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sl-anchor-icon\">\u003Csvg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\u003Cpath fill=\"currentcolor\" d=\"m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42Zm8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33ZM8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 1.1.22 1 1 0 0 0 .32-.22l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42Z\">\u003C/path>\u003C/svg>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"sr-only\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\">Section titled “Functions API”\u003C/span>\u003C/a>\u003C/div>\n\u003Cp>Create, deploy, and manage serverless functions programmatically.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"sl-heading-wrapper level-h2\">\u003Ch2 id=\"list-functions\">List Functions\u003C/h2>\u003Ca class=\"sl-anchor-link\" href=\"#list-functions\">\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sl-anchor-icon\">\u003Csvg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\u003Cpath fill=\"currentcolor\" d=\"m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42Zm8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33ZM8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 1.1.22 1 1 0 0 0 .32-.22l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42Z\">\u003C/path>\u003C/svg>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"sr-only\" da