"get-function","Get Function",{"depth":25,"slug":178,"text":179},"create-function","Create Function",{"depth":25,"slug":181,"text":182},"update-function","Update Function",{"depth":25,"slug":184,"text":185},"delete-function","Delete Function",{"depth":25,"slug":187,"text":188},"deploy-function","Deploy Function",{"depth":25,"slug":190,"text":191},"get-function-stats","Get Function Stats",{"depth":25,"slug":144,"text":145},{"depth":25,"slug":194,"text":195},"try-it-out","Try It Out",[],[],{"title":157,"description":158},[],"bundles",{"id":200,"data":202,"body":208,"filePath":209,"digest":210,"rendered":211},{"title":203,"description":204,"editUrl":8,"head":205,"template":10,"sidebar":206,"pagefind":8,"draft":13},"Bundles Overview","One-click backends for common application types. Deploy Auth, Payments, Database, and more in seconds.",[],{"order":12,"hidden":13,"attrs":207},{},"import { Card, CardGrid } from '@astrojs/starlight/components';\n\n# Backend-in-a-Box Bundles\n\nPre-configured backends for common application types. One click deploys Auth, Payments, Database, Email, and Analytics—so you can focus on your product instead of infrastructure.\n\n\u003CCardGrid>\n  \u003CCard title=\"SaaS Starter\" icon=\"seti:custom\">\n    Auth, User DB, Stripe payments, Email workflows, and Analytics. Everything you need to launch a SaaS product.\n  \u003C/Card>\n  \u003CCard title=\"Marketplace\" icon=\"seti:custom\">\n    Seller profiles, Listings, Payments split, Reviews, and Admin tools. Build multi-vendor platforms without the complexity.\n  \u003C/Card>\n  \u003CCard title=\"AI App\" icon=\"seti:custom\">\n    LLM integrations, Vector DB, Prompt management, and Usage tracking. Ship AI-powered applications faster.\n  \u003C/Card>\n\u003C/CardGrid>\n\n## Why Bundles?\n\nBuilding a SaaS, marketplace, or AI app from scratch means stitching together dozens of services—auth, payments, databases, email, analytics. Bundles give you a head start:\n\n- **One-click deployment** — Your backend is pre-configured and ready in seconds\n- **Proven architecture** — Built on battle-tested patterns used by thousands of applications\n- **Zero lock-in** — Each component can be customized or replaced\n- **Automatic updates** — Security patches and feature updates applied seamlessly\n\n## Getting Started\n\n1. Choose a bundle that matches your use case\n2. Click **Deploy** in the dashboard\n3. Configure your domain and branding\n4. Start building your frontend—your backend is ready\n\n## Bundle Details\n\n| Bundle | Price | Best For |\n|--------|-------|----------|\n| **SaaS Starter** | $29/mo | Launching a SaaS product |\n| **Marketplace** | $49/mo | Multi-vendor platforms |\n| **AI App** | $39/mo | AI-powered applications |\n\nAll bundles include a **3-month founder mode**—free until you hit 100 users or $1K MRR. No credit card required to start.","src/content/docs/bundles/index.md","e300e48e40155565",{"html":212,"metadata":213},"\u003Cp>import { Card, CardGrid } from ‘@astrojs/starlight/components’;\u003C/p>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"sl-heading-wrapper level-h1\">\u003Ch1 id=\"backend-in-a-box-bundles\">Backend-in-a-Box Bundles\u003C/h1>\u003Ca class=\"sl-anchor-link\" href=\"#backend-in-a-box-bundles\">\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sl-anchor-icon\">\u003Csvg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\u003Cpath fill=\"currentcolor\" d=\"m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42Zm8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33ZM8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 1.1.22 1 1 0 0 0 .32-.22l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42Z\">\u003C/path>\u003C/svg>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"sr-only\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\">Section titled “Backend-in-a-Box Bundles”\u003C/span>\u003C/a>\u003C/d