re-configured and ready in seconds\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Proven architecture\u003C/strong> — Built on battle-tested patterns used by thousands of applications\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Zero lock-in\u003C/strong> — Each component can be customized or replaced\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Automatic updates\u003C/strong> — Security patches and feature updates applied seamlessly\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"sl-heading-wrapper level-h2\">\u003Ch2 id=\"getting-started\">Getting Started\u003C/h2>\u003Ca class=\"sl-anchor-link\" href=\"#getting-started\">\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sl-anchor-icon\">\u003Csvg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\u003Cpath fill=\"currentcolor\" d=\"m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42Zm8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33ZM8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 1.1.22 1 1 0 0 0 .32-.22l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42Z\">\u003C/path>\u003C/svg>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"sr-only\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\">Section titled “Getting Started”\u003C/span>\u003C/a>\u003C/div>\n\u003Col>\n\u003Cli>Choose a bundle that matches your use case\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Click \u003Cstrong>Deploy\u003C/strong> in the dashboard\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Configure your domain and branding\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Start building your frontend—your backend is ready\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ol>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"sl-heading-wrapper level-h2\">\u003Ch2 id=\"bundle-details\">Bundle Details\u003C/h2>\u003Ca class=\"sl-anchor-link\" href=\"#bundle-details\">\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sl-anchor-icon\">\u003Csvg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\u003Cpath fill=\"currentcolor\" d=\"m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 