 0 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42Z\">\u003C/path>\u003C/svg>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"sr-only\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\">Section titled “Examples”\u003C/span>\u003C/a>\u003C/div>\n\u003Cp>See the \u003Ca href=\"/docs/examples\">examples\u003C/a> directory for more function templates:\u003C/p>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>HTTP API handlers\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Webhook processors\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Data transformations\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>AI/ML inference\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>",{"headings":611,"localImagePaths":644,"remoteImagePaths":645,"frontmatter":646,"imagePaths":647},[612,614,617,620,623,626,629,632,633,636,637,640,643],{"depth":12,"slug":613,"text":600},"writing-functions",{"depth":25,"slug":615,"text":616},"supported-runtimes","Supported Runtimes",{"depth":25,"slug":618,"text":619},"testing-functions","Testing Functions",{"depth":25,"slug":621,"text":622},"function-structure","Function Structure",{"depth":61,"slug":624,"text":625},"python","Python",{"depth":61,"slug":627,"text":628},"nodejs","Node.js",{"depth":25,"slug":630,"text":631},"request-object","Request Object",{"depth":25,"slug":144,"text":145},{"depth":25,"slug":634,"text":635},"dependencies","Dependencies",{"depth":25,"slug":418,"text":419},{"depth":25,"slug":638,"text":639},"working-with-files","Working with Files",{"depth":25,"slug":641,"text":642},"error-handling","Error Handling",{"depth":25,"slug":438,"text":439},[],[],{"title":600,"description":601},[],{"id":222,"data":649,"body":654,"filePath":655,"digest":656,"rendered":657},{"title":223,"description":650,"editUrl":8,"head":651,"template":10,"sidebar":652,"pagefind":8,"draft":13},"Quick start guide for FunctionFly™",[],{"hidden":13,"attrs":653},{},"# Getting Started with FunctionFly™\n\nWelcome to FunctionFly™, a production-ready serverless function platform built with Go.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\n# Install the ffly CLI\ncurl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/functionfly/functionfly/main/scripts/install.sh | bash\n\n# Login\nffly login\n\n# Initialize a function\nffly init my-function\n\n# Run locally\nffly dev\n\n# Publish to registry\nffly publish\n\n# Or test your function instantly in the [Playground](/guides/playground/)\n```\n\n## Installation\n\n### CLI Installation\n\n```bash\n# Linux/macOS\ncurl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/functionfly/functionfly/main/scripts/install.sh | bash\n\n# Homebrew (macOS)\nbrew tap functionfly/tap\nbrew install ffly\n\n# From source\ngo build -o bin/fly ./cmd/fly\n```\n\n### Verify Installation\n\n```bash\nfly --version\nffly login --help\n```\n\n## Your First Function\n\nCreate a new function and deploy it in minutes:\n\n```javascript\n// main.py - Python function\nexport default async function(req) {\n  return {\n    status: 200,\n    body: `Hello, ${req.body.name || 'World'}!`\n  };\n}\n```\n\n```bash\nffly init hello-world\ncd hello-world\nffly dev  # Test locally\nffly publish  # Deploy to production\n```\n\n## Next Steps\n\n- [Functions Guide](/docs/functions) - Learn about writing functions\n- [Deployment](/docs/deployment) - Deploy to production\n- [API Reference](/docs/api) - Full API documentation\n- [Function Playground](/guides/playground/) - Test functions interactively\n- [Examples](/docs/examples) - Sample functions","src/content/docs/getting-started.md","8c10259eaeda9324",{"html":658,"metadata":659},"\u003Cdiv class=\"sl-heading-wrapper level-h1\">\u003Ch1 id=\"getting-started-with-functionfly\">Getting Started with FunctionFly™\u003C/h1>\u003Ca class=\"sl-anchor-link\" href=\"#getting-started-with-functionfly\">\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sl-anchor-icon\">\u003Csvg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\u003Cpath fill=\"currentcolor\" d=\"m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42Zm8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.4