EEB;--1:#403F53\"> \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#ECC48D;--1:#3B61B0\">rotate\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53\"> \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#ECC48D;--1:#3B61B0\">&#x3C;old-key-id>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53\"> \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0\">--name\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53\"> \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#D9F5DD;--1:#111111\">\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#ECC48D;--1:#984E4D\">Production API (Rotated)\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#D9F5DD;--1:#111111\">\"\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"ec-line\">\u003Cdiv class=\"code\">\n\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"ec-line\">\u003Cdiv class=\"code\">\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#919F9F;--1:#5F636F\"># The old key remains active for 24 hours\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"ec-line\">\u003Cdiv class=\"code\">\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#919F9F;--1:#5F636F\"># Update your applications with the new key\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"ec-line\">\u003Cdiv class=\"code\">\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#919F9F;--1:#5F636F\"># Then revoke the old key\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"ec-line\">\u003Cdiv class=\"code\">\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0\">ffly\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53\"> \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#ECC48D;--1:#3B61B0\">keys\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53\"> \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#ECC48D;--1:#3B61B0\">revoke\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53\"> \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#ECC48D;--1:#3B61B0\">&#x3C;old-key-id>\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\u003Cdiv class=\"copy\">\u003Cdiv aria-live=\"polite\">\u003C/div>\u003Cbutton title=\"Copy to clipboard\" data-copied=\"Copied!\" data-code=\"ffly keys rotate \u003Cold-key-id> --name &#x22;Production API (Rotated)&#x22;ffly keys revoke \u003Cold-key-id>\">\u003Cdiv>\u003C/div>\u003C/button>\u003C/div>\u003C/figure>\u003C/div>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"sl-heading-wrapper level-h2\">\u003Ch2 id=\"best-practices\">Best Practices\u003C/h2>\u003Ca class=\"sl-anchor-link\" href=\"#best-practices\">\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sl-anchor-icon\">\u003Csvg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\u003Cpath fill=\"currentcolor\" d=\"m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42Zm8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33ZM8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 1.1.22 1 1 0 0 0 .32-.22l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42Z\">\u003C/path>\u003C/svg>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"sr-only\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\">Section titled “Best Practices”\u003C/span>\u003C/a>\u003C/div>\n\u003Col>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Use environment-specific keys\u003C/strong>: Separate keys for dev, staging, and production\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Principle of least privilege\u003C/strong>: Grant only necessary permissions\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Rotate regularly\u003C/strong>: Change keys every 90 days\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Store securely\u003C/strong>: Use environment variables or secret managers\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Monitor usage\u003C/strong>: Review key usage in the dashboard\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ol>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"sl-heading-wrapper level-h2\">\u003Ch2 id=\"troubleshooting\">Troubleshooting\u003C/h2>\u003Ca class=\"sl-anchor-link\" href=\"#troubleshooting\">\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sl-anchor-icon\">\u003Csvg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\u003Cpath fill=\"currentcolor\" d=\"m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33