0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42Zm8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33ZM8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 1.1.22 1 1 0 0 0 .32-.22l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42Z\">\u003C/path>\u003C/svg>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"sr-only\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\">Section titled “Cancelling Subscription”\u003C/span>\u003C/a>\u003C/div>\n\u003Col>\n\u003Cli>Go to \u003Cstrong>Settings → Billing → Plan\u003C/strong>\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Click \u003Cstrong>Cancel Subscription\u003C/strong>\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Choose cancellation date (now or end of cycle)\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Confirm cancellation\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ol>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>After cancellation:\u003C/strong>\u003C/p>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>You retain access until the end of your paid period\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Data is retained for 30 days\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>You can reactivate anytime\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Chr>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"sl-heading-wrapper level-h2\">\u003Ch2 id=\"wallet--credits\">Wallet &#x26; Credits\u003C/h2>\u003Ca class=\"sl-anchor-link\" href=\"#wallet--credits\">\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sl-anchor-icon\">\u003Csvg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\u003Cpath fill=\"currentcolor\" d=\"m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42Zm8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33ZM8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 1.1.22 1 1 0 0 0 .32-.22l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42Z\">\u003C/path>\u003C/svg>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"sr-only\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\">Section titled “Wallet &#x26; Credits”\u003C/span>\u003C/a>\u003C/div>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"sl-heading-wrapper level-h3\">\u003Ch3 id=\"adding-credits\">Adding Credits\u003C/h3>\u003Ca class=\"sl-anchor-link\" href=\"#adding-credits\">\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sl-anchor-icon\">\u003Csvg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\u003Cpath fill=\"currentcolor\" d=\"m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42Zm8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33ZM8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 1.1.22 1 1 0 0 0 .32-.22l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42Z\">\u003C/path>\u003C/svg>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"sr-only\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\">Section titled “Adding Credits”\u003C/span>\u003C/a>\u003C/div>\n\u003Col>\n\u003Cli>Go to \u003Cstrong>Wallet\u003C/strong> in the dashboard\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Click \u003Cstrong>Add Credits\u003C/strong>\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Choose amount or custom amount\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Complete payment\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ol>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\u003Ctable>\u003Cthead>\u003Ctr>\u003Cth>Amount\u003C/th>\u003Cth>Bonus\u003C/th>\u003C/tr>\u003C/thead>\u003Ctbody>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>$10+\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>None\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>$50+\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>5% bonus\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>$100+\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>10% bonus\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>$500+\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>15% bonus\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003C/tbody>\u003C/table>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"sl-heading-wrapper level-h3\">\u003Ch3 id=\"auto-recharge\">Auto-Recharge\u003C/h3>\u003Ca class=\"sl-anchor-link\" href=\"#auto-recharge\">\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sl-anchor-icon\">\u003Csvg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\u003Cpath fill=\"currentcolor\" d=\"m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2