billed at overage rate\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Hard cap\u003C/strong> at 200% — service paused until upgrade or cycle reset\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ol>\n\u003Chr>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"sl-heading-wrapper level-h2\">\u003Ch2 id=\"refunds--disputes\">Refunds &#x26; Disputes\u003C/h2>\u003Ca class=\"sl-anchor-link\" href=\"#refunds--disputes\">\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sl-anchor-icon\">\u003Csvg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\u003Cpath fill=\"currentcolor\" d=\"m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42Zm8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33ZM8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 1.1.22 1 1 0 0 0 .32-.22l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42Z\">\u003C/path>\u003C/svg>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"sr-only\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\">Section titled “Refunds &#x26; Disputes”\u003C/span>\u003C/a>\u003C/div>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"sl-heading-wrapper level-h3\">\u003Ch3 id=\"refund-policy\">Refund Policy\u003C/h3>\u003Ca class=\"sl-anchor-link\" href=\"#refund-policy\">\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sl-anchor-icon\">\u003Csvg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\u003Cpath fill=\"currentcolor\" d=\"m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42Zm8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33ZM8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 1.1.22 1 1 0 0 0 .32-.22l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42Z\">\u003C/path>\u003C/svg>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"sr-only\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\">Section titled “Refund Policy”\u003C/span>\u003C/a>\u003C/div>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Accidental charges:\u003C/strong> Full refund within 30 days\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Service outages:\u003C/strong> Pro-rated credit based on uptime SLA\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Feature not as described:\u003C/strong> Case-by-case basis\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"sl-heading-wrapper level-h3\">\u003Ch3 id=\"requesting-a-refund\">Requesting a Refund\u003C/h3>\u003Ca class=\"sl-anchor-link\" href=\"#requesting-a-refund\">\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sl-anchor-icon\">\u003Csvg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\u003Cpath fill=\"currentcolor\" d=\"m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42Zm8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33ZM8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 1.1.22 1 1 0 0 0 .32-.22l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42Z\">\u003C/path>\u003C/svg>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"sr-only\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\">Section titled “Requesting a Refund”\u003C/span>\u003C/a>\u003C/div>\n\u003Col>\n\u003Cli>Go to \u003Cstrong>Settings → Billing → Invoice\u003C/strong>\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Click \u003Cstrong>Request Refund\u003C/strong> on the invoice\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Select reason\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Submit\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ol>\n\u003Cp>Refunds typically processed within 5-7 business days.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"sl-heading-wrapper level-h3\">\u003Ch3 id=\"billing-disputes\">Billing Disputes\u003C/h3>\u003Ca class=\"sl-anchor-link\" href=\"#billing-disputes\">\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sl-anchor-icon\">\u003Csvg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\u003Cpath fill=\"currentcolor\" d=\"m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l