0 0 0 1.1.22 1 1 0 0 0 .32-.22l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42Z\">\u003C/path>\u003C/svg>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"sr-only\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\">Section titled “Next Steps”\u003C/span>\u003C/a>\u003C/div>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>Learn about \u003Ca href=\"/analytics/\">monitoring and analytics\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Explore \u003Ca href=\"/guides/rate-limiting/\">rate limiting\u003C/a> for production protection\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Set up \u003Ca href=\"/guides/webhooks/\">webhooks\u003C/a> for deployment notifications\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>",{"headings":1029,"localImagePaths":1119,"remoteImagePaths":1120,"frontmatter":1121,"imagePaths":1123},[1030,1033,1036,1039,1042,1045,1048,1051,1052,1055,1058,1061,1064,1067,1070,1073,1076,1079,1082,1085,1086,1089,1091,1093,1094,1097,1100,1103,1106,1109,1112,1114,1115,1118],{"depth":25,"slug":1031,"text":1032},"github-actions","GitHub Actions",{"depth":61,"slug":1034,"text":1035},"quick-setup","Quick Setup",{"depth":61,"slug":1037,"text":1038},"multi-environment-deployment","Multi-Environment Deployment",{"depth":61,"slug":1040,"text":1041},"testing-before-deploy","Testing Before Deploy",{"depth":25,"slug":1043,"text":1044},"gitlab-ci","GitLab CI",{"depth":61,"slug":1046,"text":1047},"basic-configuration","Basic Configuration",{"depth":25,"slug":1049,"text":1050},"circleci","CircleCI",{"depth":61,"slug":427,"text":428},{"depth":25,"slug":1053,"text":1054},"jenkins","Jenkins",{"depth":61,"slug":1056,"text":1057},"pipeline-script","Pipeline Script",{"depth":25,"slug":1059,"text":1060},"azure-devops","Azure DevOps",{"depth":61,"slug":1062,"text":1063},"pipeline-configuration","Pipeline Configuration",{"depth":25,"slug":1065,"text":1066},"terraform-integration","Terraform Integration",{"depth":61,"slug":1068,"text":1069},"infrastructure-as-code","Infrastructure as Code",{"depth":25,"slug":1071,"text":1072},"environment-management","Environment Management",{"depth":61,"slug":1074,"text":1075},"staging-vs-production","Staging vs Production",{"depth":61,"slug":1077,"text":1078},"feature-flags","Feature Flags",{"depth":25,"slug":1080,"text":1081},"rollback-strategies","Rollback Strategies",{"depth":61,"slug":1083,"text":1084},"automatic-rollback","Automatic Rollback",{"depth":61,"slug":523,"text":524},{"depth":25,"slug":1087,"text":1088},"secrets-in-cicd","Secrets in CI/CD",{"depth":61,"slug":1090,"text":1032},"github-actions-1",{"depth":61,"slug":1092,"text":1044},"gitlab-ci-1",{"depth":61,"slug":533,"text":534},{"depth":25,"slug":1095,"text":1096},"testing-deployments","Testing Deployments",{"depth":61,"slug":1098,"text":1099},"smoke-tests","Smoke Tests",{"depth":61,"slug":1101,"text":1102},"integration-in-ci","Integration in CI",{"depth":25,"slug":1104,"text":1105},"monitoring-deployments","Monitoring Deployments",{"depth":61,"slug":1107,"text":1108},"deployment-notifications","Deployment Notifications",{"depth":61,"slug":1110,"text":1111},"deployment-metrics","Deployment Metrics",{"depth":25,"slug":1113,"text":534},"best-practices-1",{"depth":25,"slug":784,"text":785},{"depth":61,"slug":1116,"text":1117},"common-issues","Common Issues",{"depth":25,"slug":290,"text":291},[],[],{"title":1017,"description":1018,"sidebar":1122},{"order":1021},[],"guides/cloudflare-workers",{"id":1124,"data":1126,"body":1132,"filePath":1133,"digest":1134,"rendered":1135},{"title":1127,"description":1128,"editUrl":8,"head":1129,"template":10,"sidebar":1130,"pagefind":8,"draft":13},"Cloudflare Workers","Deploy FunctionFly functions to Cloudflare Workers",[],{"hidden":13,"attrs":1131},{},"# Cloudflare Workers\n\nDeploy your FunctionFly functions to [Cloudflare Workers](https://workers.cloudflare.com/) for ultra-low latency edge compute with global anycast.\n\n## Features\n\n- **\u003C5ms cold start** - Fastest edge runtime\n- **Global anycast** - 300+ cities worldwide\n- ** Durable Objects** - Stateful edge compute\n- **Workers KV** - Global key-value store\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Cloudflare account with Workers enabled\n- Wrangler CLI installed: `npm i -g wrangler`\n\n## Configuration\n\n```jsonc\n// functionfly.jsonc\n{\n  \"provider\": \"workers\",\n  \"provider_config\": {\n    \"account_id\": \"your-cloudflare-account-id\",\n    \"workers_subdomain\": \"your-subdomain\",\n    \"routes\": [\"*.yourdomain.com/*\"]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Deployment\n\n```bash\n# Deploy to Cloudflare Workers\nffly deploy --provider workers\n\n# Deploy to specific zone\nffly deploy --provider workers --zone yourdomain.com\n```\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n```bash\n# Set Cloudflare credentials\nffly env set CF_ACCOUNT_ID=your_account --provider workers\nffly env set CF_API_TOKEN=your_api_token --provider workers\nffly env set CF_ZONE_ID=your_zone_id --provider workers\n```\n\n## Workers KV Integration\n\nFunctionFly automatically integrates with Workers KV:\n\n```javascript\n// Access KV from your function\nconst value = await KV.get('my-key');\nawait KV.put('my-key', 'my-value');\n```\n\n## Limitations\n\n- Maximum 512MB memory\n- Maximum 30 second timeout\n- No Node.js APIs (use WinterCG)\n- CPU time limited (not wall time)","src/content/docs/guides/cloudflare-workers.md","c49dc0248f041498",{"html":1136,"metadata":1137},"\u003Cdiv class=\"sl-heading-wrapper level-h1\">\u003Ch1 id=\"cloudflare-workers\">Cloudflare Workers\u003C/h1>\u003Ca class=\"sl-anchor-link\" href=\"#cloudflare-workers\">\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sl-anchor-icon\">\u003Csvg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\u003Cpath fill=\"currentcolor\" d=\"m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42Zm8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33ZM8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 1.1.22 1 1 0 0 0 .32-.22l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l