>\n\u003Cli>View certificate details:\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>Issuer\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Expiration date\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Subject Alternative Names (SANs)\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ol>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"sl-heading-wrapper level-h3\">\u003Ch3 id=\"certificate-issues\">Certificate Issues\u003C/h3>\u003Ca class=\"sl-anchor-link\" href=\"#certificate-issues\">\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sl-anchor-icon\">\u003Csvg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\u003Cpath fill=\"currentcolor\" d=\"m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42Zm8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33ZM8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 1.1.22 1 1 0 0 0 .32-.22l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42Z\">\u003C/path>\u003C/svg>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"sr-only\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\">Section titled “Certificate Issues”\u003C/span>\u003C/a>\u003C/div>\n\u003Cp>If SSL fails after DNS propagation:\u003C/p>\n\u003Col>\n\u003Cli>Check certificate status in dashboard\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Verify DNS records are correct\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Wait 5-10 minutes for auto-retry\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>If still failing, click \u003Cstrong>Recheck\u003C/strong> to trigger reissuance\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ol>\n\u003Chr>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"sl-heading-wrapper level-h2\">\u003Ch2 id=\"step-4-route-traffic-to-functions\">Step 4: Route Traffic to Functions\u003C/h2>\u003Ca class=\"sl-anchor-link\" href=\"#step-4-route-traffic-to-functions\">\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sl-anchor-icon\">\u003Csvg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\u003Cpath fill=\"currentcolor\" d=\"m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l