 Dashboard",{"depth":61,"slug":1301,"text":1302},"domain-verification","Domain Verification",{"depth":61,"slug":1304,"text":1305},"verification-status","Verification Status",{"depth":25,"slug":1307,"text":1308},"step-2-configure-dns","Step 2: Configure DNS",{"depth":61,"slug":1310,"text":1311},"for-subdomain-apis-recommended","For subdomain APIs (recommended)",{"depth":61,"slug":1313,"text":1314},"for-wildcard-subdomains","For wildcard subdomains",{"depth":61,"slug":1316,"text":1317},"for-apexnaked-domains","For apex/naked domains",{"depth":25,"slug":1319,"text":1320},"step-3-ssl-certificate","Step 3: SSL Certificate",{"depth":61,"slug":1322,"text":1323},"certificate-details","Certificate Details",{"depth":61,"slug":1325,"text":1326},"viewing-certificate","Viewing Certificate",{"depth":61,"slug":1328,"text":1329},"certificate-issues","Certificate Issues",{"depth":25,"slug":1331,"text":1332},"step-4-route-traffic-to-functions","Step 4: Route Traffic to Functions",{"depth":61,"slug":1334,"text":1335},"route-all-functions","Route All Functions",{"depth":61,"slug":1337,"text":1338},"function-path-mapping","Function Path Mapping",{"depth":25,"slug":1340,"text":1341},"using-custom-domains-in-functions","Using Custom Domains in Functions",{"depth":61,"slug":1343,"text":1344},"base-url-changes","Base URL Changes",{"depth":61,"slug":1346,"text":1347},"detecting-custom-domain-in-code","Detecting Custom Domain in Code",{"depth":25,"slug":1349,"text":1350},"multiple-custom-domains","Multiple Custom Domains",{"depth":25,"slug":1352,"text":1353},"custom-domain-limits","Custom Domain Limits",{"depth":25,"slug":784,"text":785},{"depth":61,"slug":1356,"text":1357},"domain-shows-pending-verification","Domain shows “Pending Verification”",{"depth":61,"slug":1359,"text":1360},"ssl-certificate-not-issued","SSL Certificate Not Issued",{"depth":61,"slug":1362,"text":1363},"mixed-content-errors","Mixed Content Errors",{"depth":61,"slug":1365,"text":1366},"custom-domain-not-routing","Custom Domain Not Routing",{"depth":61,"slug":1368,"text":1369},"apex-domain-not-working","Apex Domain Not Working",{"depth":25,"slug":1371,"text":1372},"advanced-configuration","Advanced Configuration",{"depth":61,"slug":1374,"text":1375},"redirect-root-domain-to-www","Redirect Root Domain to www",{"depth":61,"slug":1377,"text":1378},"path-based-routing","Path-Based Routing",{"depth":61,"slug":1380,"text":1381},"wildcard-subdomains","Wildcard Subdomains",{"depth":25,"slug":1383,"text":1384},"removing-a-custom-domain","Removing a Custom Domain",{"depth":25,"slug":533,"text":534},[],[],{"title":1279,"description":1280,"sidebar":1389},{"order":1283},[],"guides/deno-deploy",{"id":1391,"data":1393,"body":1399,"filePath":1400,"digest":1401,"rendered":1402},{"title":1394,"description":1395,"editUrl":8,"head":1396,"template":10,"sidebar":1397,"pagefind":8,"draft":13},"Deno Deploy","Deploy FunctionFly functions to Deno Deploy",[],{"hidden":13,"attrs":1398},{},"# Deno Deploy\n\nDeploy your FunctionFly functions to [Deno Deploy](https://deno.com/deploy) for a modern JavaScript/TypeScript edge runtime with native Deno APIs.\n\n## Features\n\n- **Native Deno APIs** - Full Deno runtime at the edge\n- **\u003C10ms cold start** - Lightning fast execution\n- **TypeScript native** - No build step required\n- **Web standard APIs** - Use browser-compatible APIs\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Deno account\n- Deno Deploy project created at [dash.deno.com](https://dash.deno.com)\n\n## Configuration\n\n```jsonc\n// functionfly.jsonc\n{\n  \"provider\": \"deno-deploy\",\n  \"provider_config\": {\n    \"project\": \"my-project\",\n    \"kv_namespace\": \"my-kv\",\n    \"regions\": [\"us-east\", \"eu-west\", \"ap-northeast\"]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Deployment\n\n```bash\n# Deploy to Deno Deploy\nffly deploy --provider deno-deploy\n\n# Deploy specific region\nffly deploy --provider deno-deploy --region us-east\n```\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n```bash\n# Set Deno Deploy credentials\nffly env set DENO_DEPLOY_TOKEN=your_token --provider deno-deploy\nffly env set DENO_DEPLOY_PROJECT=my-project --provider deno-deploy\n```\n\n## Deno KV Integration\n\nFunctionFly integrates with Deno's built-in KV:\n\n```javascript\n// Use Deno KV at the edge\nconst kv = await Deno.openKv();\nconst result = await kv.get([\"users\", \"123\"]);\nawait kv.set([\"users\", \"123\"], { name: \"Alice\" });\n```\n\n## Supported APIs\n\n- `fetch` - Standard Web Fetch API\n- `WebSocket` - Real-time connections\n- `Crypto` - Web Crypto API\n- `Streams` - Web Streams API\n- `Deno KV` - Key-value store\n- `Deno Queues` - Message queues\n\n## Limitations\n\n- Maximum 512MB memory\n- Maximum 30 second timeout\n- JavaScript/TypeScript only\n- Deno-specific APIs (not Node.js)","src/content/docs/guides/deno-deploy.md","e2360599b2c649b5",{"html":1403,"metadata":1404},"\u003Cdiv class=\"sl-heading-wrapper level-h1\">\u003Ch1 id=\"deno-deploy\">Deno Deploy\u003C/h1>\u003Ca class=\"sl-anchor-link\" href=\"#deno-deploy\">\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sl-anchor-icon\">\u003Csvg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\u003Cpath fill=\"currentcolor\" d=\"m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42Zm8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33ZM8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 1.1.22 1 1 0 0 0 .32-.22l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42Z\">\u003C/path>\u003C/svg>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"sr-only\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\">Section titled “Deno Deploy”\u003C/span>\u003C/a>\u003C/div>\n\u003Cp>Deploy your FunctionFly functions to \u003Ca href=\"https://deno.com/deploy\">Deno Deploy\u003C/a> for a modern JavaScript/TypeScript edge runtime with native Deno APIs.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"sl-heading-wrapper level-h2\">\u003Ch2 id=