h":61,"slug":1572,"text":1573},"err_cannot_delete_function","ERR_CANNOT_DELETE_FUNCTION",{"depth":25,"slug":1575,"text":1576},"statefabric-errors","StateFabric Errors",{"depth":61,"slug":1578,"text":1579},"err_state_object_not_found","ERR_STATE_OBJECT_NOT_FOUND",{"depth":61,"slug":1581,"text":1582},"err_state_transaction_conflict","ERR_STATE_TRANSACTION_CONFLICT",{"depth":61,"slug":1584,"text":1585},"err_state_snapshot_corrupt","ERR_STATE_SNAPSHOT_CORRUPT",{"depth":25,"slug":1587,"text":1588},"agent-errors","Agent Errors",{"depth":61,"slug":1590,"text":1591},"err_agent_not_initialized","ERR_AGENT_NOT_INITIALIZED",{"depth":61,"slug":1593,"text":1594},"err_agent_loop_detected","ERR_AGENT_LOOP_DETECTED",{"depth":61,"slug":1596,"text":1597},"err_trust_verification_failed","ERR_TRUST_VERIFICATION_FAILED",{"depth":25,"slug":1599,"text":1600},"network--connection-errors","Network & Connection Errors",{"depth":61,"slug":1602,"text":1603},"err_connection_refused","ERR_CONNECTION_REFUSED",{"depth":61,"slug":1605,"text":1606},"err_ssl_certificate_invalid","ERR_SSL_CERTIFICATE_INVALID",{"depth":61,"slug":1608,"text":1609},"err_dns_resolution_failed","ERR_DNS_RESOLUTION_FAILED",{"depth":25,"slug":1611,"text":1612},"data--storage-errors","Data & Storage Errors",{"depth":61,"slug":1614,"text":1615},"err_database_connection_failed","ERR_DATABASE_CONNECTION_FAILED",{"depth":61,"slug":1617,"text":1618},"err_storage_quota_exceeded","ERR_STORAGE_QUOTA_EXCEEDED",{"depth":25,"slug":1620,"text":1621},"rate-limiting","Rate Limiting",{"depth":61,"slug":1623,"text":1624},"understanding-rate-limits","Understanding Rate Limits",{"depth":61,"slug":1626,"text":1627},"implementing-backoff","Implementing Backoff",{"depth":25,"slug":1629,"text":1630},"getting-help","Getting Help",[],[],{"title":1507,"description":1508,"sidebar":1634},{"order":1511},[],"guides/fly-io",{"id":1636,"data":1638,"body":1644,"filePath":1645,"digest":1646,"rendered":1647},{"title":1639,"description":1640,"editUrl":8,"head":1641,"template":10,"sidebar":1642,"pagefind":8,"draft":13},"Fly.io","Deploy FunctionFly functions to Fly.io",[],{"hidden":13,"attrs":1643},{},"# Fly.io\n\nDeploy your FunctionFly functions to [Fly.io](https://fly.io/) for distributed applications with edge nodes close to your users.\n\n## Features\n\n- **Distributed edge** - 30+ regions worldwide\n- **Anycast networking** - Automatic routing to nearest instance\n- **Persistent storage** - Fly Volumes for data\n- **Custom scaling** - Scale to zero and back\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Fly.io account\n- Fly CLI installed: `npm i -g @flydotio/docker`\n\n## Configuration\n\n```jsonc\n// functionfly.jsonc\n{\n  \"provider\": \"fly\",\n  \"provider_config\": {\n    \"app_name\": \"my-functionfly-app\",\n    \"primary_region\": \"ord\",\n    \"regions\": [\"ord\", \"iad\", \"lax\", \"sfo\", \"cdg\"]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Deployment\n\n```bash\n# Deploy to Fly.io\nffly deploy --provider fly\n\n# Deploy specific region\nffly deploy --provider fly --region ord\n```\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n```bash\n# Set Fly.io tokens\nffly env set FLY_API_TOKEN=your_token --provider fly\nffly env set FLY_APP_NAME=my-app --provider fly\n```\n\n## Fly Volumes\n\nFor persistent storage, FunctionFly uses Fly Volumes:\n\n```javascript\n// Volume mount at /vol/data\nconst fs = require('fs');\nconst data = fs.readFileSync('/vol/data/file.txt');\n```\n\n## Limitations\n\n- Maximum 256MB memory per instance\n- Maximum 120 second timeout\n- No free tier for production\n- Requires Docker for custom runtimes","src/content/docs/guides/fly-io.md","5026f0cd7beba81b",{"html":1648,"metadata":1649},"\u003Cdiv class=\"sl-heading-wrapper level-h1\">\u003Ch1 id=\"flyio\">Fly.io\u003C/h1>\u003Ca class=\"sl-anchor-link\" href=\"#flyio\">\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sl-anchor-icon\">\u003Csvg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\u003Cpath fill=\"currentcolor\" d=\"m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1