curity-settings\">\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sl-anchor-icon\">\u003Csvg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\u003Cpath fill=\"currentcolor\" d=\"m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42Zm8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33ZM8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 1.1.22 1 1 0 0 0 .32-.22l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42Z\">\u003C/path>\u003C/svg>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"sr-only\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\">Section titled “Security Settings”\u003C/span>\u003C/a>\u003C/div>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"sl-heading-wrapper level-h4\">\u003Ch4 id=\"multi-factor-authentication-mfa\">Multi-Factor Authentication (MFA)\u003C/h4>\u003Ca class=\"sl-anchor-link\" href=\"#multi-factor-authentication-mfa\">\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sl-anchor-icon\">\u003Csvg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\u003Cpath fill=\"currentcolor\" d=\"m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42Zm8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33ZM8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 1.1.22 1 1 0 0 0 .32-.22l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42Z\">\u003C/path>\u003C/svg>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"sr-only\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\">Section titled “Multi-Factor Authentication (MFA)”\u003C/span>\u003C/a>\u003C/div>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Enforce MFA for all members (Professional+):\u003C/strong>\u003C/p>\n\u003Col>\n\u003Cli>Go to \u003Cstrong>Settings → Security\u003C/strong>\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Enable \u003Cstrong>Require MFA\u003C/strong>\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Members have 7 days to enroll\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>After grace period, MFA is required to access\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ol>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"sl-heading-wrapper level-h4\">\u003Ch4 id=\"session-management\">Session Management\u003C/h4>\u003Ca class=\"sl-anchor-link\" href=\"#session-management\">\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sl-anchor-icon\">\u003Csvg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\u003Cpath fill=\"currentcolor\" d=\"m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42Zm8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33ZM8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 1.1.22 1 1 0 0 0 .32-.22l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42Z\">\u003C/path>\u003C/svg>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"sr-only\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\">Section titled “Session Management”\u003C/span>\u003C/a>\u003C/div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\u003Ctable>\u003Cthead>\u003Ctr>\u003Cth>Setting\u003C/th>\u003Cth>Default\u003C/th>\u003Cth>Description\u003C/th>\u003C/tr>\u003C/thead>\u003Ctbody>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>Session timeout\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>24 hours\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>Auto-logout after inactivity\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>Max sessions\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>5\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>Concurrent sessions per user\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>Session logging\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>Enabled\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>Track all session activity\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003C/tbody>\u003C/table>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"sl-heading-wrapper level-h3\">\u003Ch3 id=\"api-access\">API Access\u003C/h3>\u003Ca class=\"sl-anchor-link\" href=\"#api-access\">\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sl-anchor-icon\">\u003Csvg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\u003Cpath fill=\"currentcolor\" d=\"m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42Zm8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33ZM8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 1.1.22 1 1 0 0 0 .32-.22l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42Z\">\u003C/path>\u003C/svg>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"sr-only\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\">Section titled “API Access”\u003C/span>\u003C/a>\u003C/div>\n\u003Cp>Generate API keys scoped to your organization:\u003C/p>\n\u003Col>\n\u003Cli>Go to \u003Cstrong>Settings → API Keys\u003C/strong>\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Click \u003Cstrong>Create Organization API Key\u003C/strong>\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Name the key\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Set permissions (read-only, read-write, admin)\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Copy and store securely\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ol>\n\u003Chr>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"sl-heading-wrapper level-h2\">\u003Ch2 id=\"sso--enterprise-identity-enterprise\">SSO &#x26; Enterprise Identity (Enterprise)\u003C/h2>\u003Ca class=\"sl-anchor-link\" href=\"#sso--enterprise-identity-enterprise\">\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sl-anchor-icon\">\u003Csvg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\u003Cpath fill=\"currentcolor\" d=\"m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42Zm8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33ZM8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 1.1.22 1 1 0 0 0 .32-.22l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42Z\">\u003C/path>\u003C/svg>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"sr-only\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\">Section titled “SSO &#x26; Enterprise Identity (Enterprise)”\u003C/span>\u003C/a>\u003C/div>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"sl-heading-wrapper level-h3\">\u003Ch3 id=\"saml-single-sign-on\">SAML Single Sign-On\u003C/h3>\u003Ca class=\"sl-anchor-link\" href=\"#saml-single-sign-on\">\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sl-anchor-icon\">\u003Csvg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\u003Cpath fill=\"currentcolor\" d=\"m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42Zm8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33ZM8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 1.1.22 1 1 0 0 0 .32-.22l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42Z\">\u003C/path>\u003C/svg>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"sr-only\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\">Section titled “SAML Single Sign-On”\u003C/span>\u003C/a>\u003C/div>\n\u003Cp>Enterprise plans support SAML 2.0 for SSO:\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Setup steps:\u003C/strong>\u003C/p>\n\u003Col>\n\u003Cli>Go to \u003Cstrong>Settings → Security → SSO\u003C/strong>\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Click \u003Cstrong>Configure SAML\u003C/strong>\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Download Service Provider metadata\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Configure your Identity Provider (IdP):\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>Entity ID: \u003Ccode dir=\"auto\">https://functionfly.com/saml/{org-slug}\u003C/code>\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>ACS URL: \u003Ccode dir=\"auto\">https://functionfly.com/saml/{org-slug}/acs\u003C/code>\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Attribute mapping:\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>\u003Ccode dir=\"auto\">email\u003C/code> → Email address\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Ccode dir=\"auto\">firstName\u003C/code> → First name\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Ccode dir=\"auto\">lastName\u003C/code> → Last name\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Upload IdP metadata XML\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Test connection\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Enable for all members\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ol>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"sl-heading-wrapper level-h3\">\u003Ch3 id=\"supported-identity-providers\">Supported Identity Providers\u003C/h3>\u003Ca class=\"sl-anchor-link\" href=\"#supported-identity-providers\">\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sl-anchor-icon\">\u003Csvg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\u003Cpath fill=\"currentcolor\" d=\"m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42Zm8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33ZM8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 1.1.22 1 1 0 0 0 .32-.22l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42Z\">\u003C/path>\u003C/svg>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"sr-only\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\">Section titled “Supported Identity Providers”\u003C/span>\u003C/a>\u003C/div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\u003Ctable>\u003Cthead>\u003Ctr>\u003Cth>Provider\u003C/th>\u003Cth>SAML Support\u003C/th>\u003Cth>OIDC Support\u003C/th>\u003C/tr>\u003C/thead>\u003Ctbody>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>Okta\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>✓\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>✓\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>Azure AD\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>✓\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>✓\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>Google Workspace\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>✓\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>✓\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>OneLogin\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>✓\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>—\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>PingFederate\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>✓\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>—\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>Custom IdP\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>✓\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>—\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003C/tbody>\u003C/table>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"sl-heading-wrapper level-h3\">\u003Ch3 id=\"just-in-time-provisioning\">Just-in-Time Provisioning\u003C/h3>\u003Ca class=\"sl-anchor-link\" href=\"#just-in-time-provisioning\">\u003