 0-6.33ZM8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 1.1.22 1 1 0 0 0 .32-.22l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42Z\">\u003C/path>\u003C/svg>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"sr-only\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\">Section titled “Transferring Ownership”\u003C/span>\u003C/a>\u003C/div>\n\u003Cp>Transfer organization ownership to another member:\u003C/p>\n\u003Col>\n\u003Cli>Go to \u003Cstrong>Settings → General\u003C/strong>\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Click \u003Cstrong>Transfer Ownership\u003C/strong>\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Select new owner\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Confirm with password\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>New owner accepts transfer\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ol>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Important:\u003C/strong>\u003C/p>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>You become an Admin after transfer\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Cannot be undone for 30 days\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>All billing responsibility transfers\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Chr>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"sl-heading-wrapper level-h2\">\u003Ch2 id=\"organization-deletion\">Organization Deletion\u003C/h2>\u003Ca class=\"sl-anchor-link\" href=\"#organization-deletion\">\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sl-anchor-icon\">\u003Csvg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\u003Cpath fill=\"currentcolor\" d=\"m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42Zm8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33ZM8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 1.1.22 1 1 0 0 0 .32-.22l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42Z\">\u003C/path>\u003C/svg>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"sr-only\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\">Section titled “Organization Deletion”\u003C/span>\u003C/a>\u003C/div>\n\u003Cp>Deleting an organization is \u003Cstrong>permanent\u003C/strong> and irreversible.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Before deletion:\u003C/strong>\u003C/p>\n\u003Col>\n\u003Cli>Download any data you need\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Cancel all active subscriptions\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Remove all team members except yourself\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ol>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Deletion steps:\u003C/strong>\u003C/p>\n\u003Col>\n\u003Cli>Go to \u003Cstrong>Settings → Danger Zone\u003C/strong>\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Click \u003Cstrong>Delete Organization\u003C/strong>\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Type organization name to confirm\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>All functions, agents, data are permanently deleted\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ol>\n\u003Chr>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"sl-heading-wrapper level-h2\">\u003Ch2 id=\"api-access-for-teams\">API Access for Teams\u003C/h2>\u003Ca class=\"sl-anchor-link\" href=\"#api-access-for-teams\">\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sl-anchor-icon\">\u003Csvg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\u003Cpath fill=\"currentcolor\" d=\"m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42Zm8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33ZM8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 1.1.22 1 1 0 0 0 .32-.22l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42Z\">\u003C/path>\u003C/svg>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"sr-only\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\">Section titled “API Access for Teams”\u003C/span>\u003C/a>\u003C/div>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"sl-heading-wrapper level-h3\">\u003Ch3 id=\"organization-api-endpoints\">Organization API Endpoints\u003C/h3>\u003Ca class=\"sl-anchor-link\" href=\"#organization-api-endpoints\">\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sl-anchor-icon\">\u003Csvg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\u003Cpath fill=\"currentcolor\" d=\"m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.