itled “Troubleshooting”\u003C/span>\u003C/a>\u003C/div>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"sl-heading-wrapper level-h3\">\u003Ch3 id=\"cant-invite-a-member\">Can’t invite a member\u003C/h3>\u003Ca class=\"sl-anchor-link\" href=\"#cant-invite-a-member\">\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sl-anchor-icon\">\u003Csvg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\u003Cpath fill=\"currentcolor\" d=\"m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42Zm8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33ZM8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 1.1.22 1 1 0 0 0 .32-.22l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42Z\">\u003C/path>\u003C/svg>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"sr-only\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\">Section titled “Can’t invite a member”\u003C/span>\u003C/a>\u003C/div>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Cause:\u003C/strong> You may not have permission (Viewer role)\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Solution:\u003C/strong> Ask an Owner or Admin to send the invite.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"sl-heading-wrapper level-h3\">\u003Ch3 id=\"invitation-expired\">Invitation expired\u003C/h3>\u003Ca class=\"sl-anchor-link\" href=\"#invitation-expired\">\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sl-anchor-icon\">\u003Csvg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\u003Cpath fill=\"currentcolor\" d=\"m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42Zm8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33ZM8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 1.1.22 1 1 0 0 0 .32-.22l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42Z\">\u003C/path>\u003C/svg>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"sr-only\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\">Section titled “Invitation expired”\u003C/span>\u003C/a>\u003C/div>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Solution:\u003C/strong> Ask an Admin to resend the invite.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"sl-heading-wrapper level-h3\">\u003Ch3 id=\"sso-login-not-working\">SSO login not working\u003C/h3>\u003Ca class=\"sl-anchor-link\" href=\"#sso-login-not-working\">\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sl-anchor-icon\">\u003Csvg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\u003Cpath fill=\"currentcolor\" d=\"m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42Zm8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33ZM8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 1.1.22 1 1 0 0 0 .32-.22l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42Z\">\u003C/path>\u003C/svg>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"sr-only\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\">Section titled “SSO login not working”\u003C/span>\u003C/a>\u003C/div>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Causes:\u003C/strong>\u003C/p>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>Misconfigured IdP\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>User not in allowed group\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Expired certificate\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Solution:\u003C/strong> Check IdP configuration in Settings → Security → SSO.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"sl-heading-wrapper level-h3\">\u003Ch3 id=\"two-factor-authentication-locked-out\">Two-factor authentication locked out\u003C/h3>\u003Ca class=\"sl-anchor-link\" href=\"#two-factor-authentication-locked-out\">\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sl-anchor-icon\">\u003Csvg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\u003Cpath fill=\"currentcolor\" d=\"m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42Zm8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33ZM8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 1.1.22 1 1 0 0 0 .32-.22l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42Z\">\u003C/path>\u003C/svg>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"sr-only\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\">Section titled “Two-factor authentication locked out”\u003C/span>\u003C/a>\u003C/div>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Solution:\u003C/strong> Use backup codes sent when MFA was enabled, or contact support for manual reset.\u003C/p>\n\u003Chr>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"sl-heading-wrapper level-h2\">\u003Ch2 id=\"best-practices\">Best Practices\u003C/h2>\u003Ca class=\"sl-anchor-link\" href=\"#best-practices\">\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sl-anchor-icon\">\u003Csvg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\u003Cpath fill=\"currentcolor\" d=\"m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42Zm8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33ZM8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 1.1.22 1 1 0 0 0 .32-.22l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42Z\">\u003C/path>\u003C/svg>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"sr-only\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\">Section titled “Best Practices”\u003C/span>\u003C/a>\u003C/div>\n\u003Col>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Follow least privilege\u003C/strong> — Give members only the permissions they need\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Enable MFA\u003C/strong> — Require MFA for all organization members\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Use SSO\u003C/strong> — Centralize identity management for Enterprise\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Regular audits\u003C/strong> — Review team members and remove inactive users\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Scoped API keys\u003C/strong> — Use limited-scope keys for CI/CD and automation\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Document roles\u003C/strong> — Keep a record of who has what role and why\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ol>",{"headings":2084,"localImagePaths":2195,"remoteImagePaths":2196,"frontmatter":2197,"imagePaths":2199},[2085,2088,2091,2094,2097,2100,2103,2106,2109,2112,2115,2118,2121,2124,2127,2130,2133,2136,2139,2142,2145,2148,2151,2154,2157,2160,2163,2166,2169,2172,2175,2178,2181,2182,2185,2188,2191,2194],{"depth":25,"slug":2086,"text":2087},"organizations-overview","Organizations Overview",{"depth":61,"slug":2089,"text":2090},"default-organization","Default Organization",{"depth":61,"slug":2092,"text":2093},"creating-an-organization","Creating an Organization",{"depth":25,"slug":2095,"text":2096},"roles--permissions","Roles & Permissions",{"depth":61,"slug":2098,"text":2099},"available-roles","Available Roles",{"depth":61,"slug":2101,"text":2102},"permission-matrix","Permission Matrix",{"depth":25,"slug":2104,"text":2105},"inviting-team-members","Inviting Team Members",{"depth":61,"slug":2107,"text":2108},"sending-invites","Sending Invites",{"depth":61,"slug":2110,"text":2111},"accepting-invites","Accepting Invites",{"depth":61,"slug":2113,"text":2114},"bulk-invites","Bulk Invites",{"depth":25,"slug":2116,"text":2117},"managing-members","Managing Members",{"depth":61,"slug":2119,"text":2120},"changing-roles","Changing Roles",{"depth":61,"slug":2122,"text":2123},"removing-members","Removing Members",{"depth":61,"slug":2125,"text":2126},"resending-invites","Resending Invites",{"depth":25,"slug":2128,"text":2129},"organization-settings","Organization Settings",{"depth":61,"slug":2131,"text":2132},"general-settings","General Settings",{"depth":61,"slug":2134,"text":2135},"security-settings","Security Settings",{"depth":73,"slug":2137,"text":2138},"multi-factor-authentication-mfa","Multi-Factor Authentication (MFA)",{"depth":73,"slug":2140,"text":2141},"session-management","Session Management",{"depth":61,"slug":2143,"text":2144},"api-access","API Access",{"depth":25,"slug":2146,"text":2147},"sso--enterprise-identity-enterprise","SSO & Enterprise Identity (Enterprise)",{"depth":61,"slug":2149,"text":2150},"saml-single-sign-on","SAML Single Sign-On",{"depth":61,"slug":2152,"text":2153},"supported-identity-providers","Supported Identity Providers",{"depth":61,"slug":2155,"text":2156},"just-in-time-provisioning","Just-in-Time Provisioning",{"depth":25,"slug":2158,"text":2159},"audit-logs","Audit Logs",{"depth":61,"slug":2161,"text":2162},"viewing-audit-logs","Viewing Audit Logs",{"depth":61,"slug":2164,"text":2165},"log-retention","Log Retention",{"depth":25,"slug":2167,"text":2168},"transferring-ownership","Transferring Ownership",{"depth":25,"slug":2170,"text":2171},"organization-deletion","Organization Deletion",{"depth":25,"slug":2173,"text":2174},"api-access-for-teams","API Access for Teams",{"depth":61,"slug":2176,"text":2177},"organization-api-endpoints","Organization API Endpoints",{"depth":61,"slug":2179,"text":2180},"scoped-api-keys","Scoped API Keys",{"depth":25,"slug":784,"text":785},{"depth":61,"slug":2183,"text":2184},"cant-invite-a-member","Can’t invite a member",{"depth":61,"slug":2186,"text":2187},"invitation-expired","Invitation expired",{"depth":61,"slug":2189,"text":2190},"sso-login-not-working","SSO login not working",{"depth":61,"slug":2192,"text":2193},"two-factor-authentication-locked-out","Two-factor authentication locked out",{"depth":25,"slug":533,"text":534},[],[],{"title":2072,"description":2073,"sidebar":2198},{"order":2076},[],"guides/playground",{"id":2200,"data":2202,"body":2208,"filePath":2209,"digest":2210,"rendered":2211},{"title":2203,"description":2204,"editUrl":8,"head":2205,"template":10,"sidebar":2206,"pagefind":8,"draft":13},"Function Playground","Test and debug your functions interactively using the FunctionFly playground.",[],{"order":61,"hidden":13,"attrs":2207},{},"The Function Playground is an interactive environment where you can test your functions before deploying them to production. It provides a real-time execution environment with support for streaming responses, variable substitution, and detailed execution history.\n\n## Accessing the Playground\n\nYou can access the playground in two ways:\n\n1. **From the Registry**: Visit any function's page and click the \"Try It\" button\n2. **Direct URL**: Navigate to `/playground/{author}/{function-name}`\n\n## Interface Overview\n\nThe playground consists of several panels:\n\n### Input Panel\n\nThe input panel accepts JSON input for your function. You can switch between:\n\n- **Form Mode**: A structured form view based on the function's input schema\n- **JSON Mode**: Direct JSON editor with syntax highlighting\n- **Examples Mode**: Select from pre-configured examples or the function's default input\n\n### Output Panel\n\nThe output panel displays the execution results:\n\n- **Response Tab**: The function's returned data\n- **Headers Tab**: Response headers (useful for debugging)\n- **Timeline Tab**: Execution timeline visualization\n- **Diff Tab**: Compare outputs from different executions\n\n### Sidebar\n\nThe sidebar provides additional tools:\n\n- **History**: View past executions and compare results\n- **Variables**: Define reusable variables with `{{variable_name}}` syntax\n- **Schema**: View the function's input/output schema\n- **Snippets**: Code snippets for calling the function from various SDKs\n- **Share**: Generate shareable links with pre-filled input\n- **Info**: Function metadata, pricing, and reliability scores\n\n## Variable Substitution\n\nUse variables to reuse values across multiple executions:\n\n```\n{{api_key}}\n{{user_id}}\n{{base_url}}\n```\n\nVariables are defined in the sidebar and persist across sessions.\n\n## Keyboard Shortcuts\n\n| Shortcut | Action |\n|----------|--------|\n| `Cmd/Ctrl + Enter` | Execute function |\n| `Cmd/Ctrl + Shift + F` | Format JSON |\n| `Cmd/Ctrl + Shift + R` | Reset playground |\n| `Cmd/Ctrl + Shift + C` | Copy shareable link |\n\n## Sharing and Embedding\n\n### Shareable Links\n\nClick \"Share\" in the sidebar to generate a URL that encodes:\n\n- Function author and name\n- Input data\n- Selected version\n\n### Embed Snippets\n\nGet embeddable code snippets for:\n\n- cURL\n- JavaScript (Fetch)\n- Python\n- Go\n\n## Adding Examples to Your Function\n\nTo populate the Examples dropdown, add an `examples` array to your function's manifest:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"my-function\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"runtime\": \"nodejs\",\n  \"input\": {\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n      \"name\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n      \"count\": { \"type\": \"integer\" }\n    }\n  },\n  \"examples\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Basic Example\",\n      \"input\": {\n        \"name\": \"World\",\n        \"count\": 42\n      },\n      \"description\": \"A simple example demonstrating basic usage\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Empty Count\",\n      \"input\": {\n        \"name\": \"Test\"\n      },\n      \"description\": \"Example with default count\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\nEach example must include:\n\n- `name`: Display name shown in the dropdown\n- `input`: Valid JSON input matching the function's schema\n- `description` (optional): Additional context about the example\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Use descriptive example names**: Make it clear what each example demonstrates\n2. **Include edge cases**: Add examples for boundary conditions and error handling\n3. **Keep inputs realistic**: Examples should reflect real-world usage patterns\n4. **Document variable usage**: If using variables, include comments explaining their purpose\n\n## Next Steps\n\n- Learn about [secrets vault](/guides/secrets-vault/) for secure credential storage\n- Explore [state fabric](/guides/statefabric/) for persistent state management\n- Read the [functions API reference](/api/functions/) for programmatic access","src/content/docs/guides/playground.md","b4d4673efd788171",{"html":2212,"metadata":2213},"\u003Cp>The Function Playground is an interactive environment where you can test your functions before deploying them to production. It provides a real-time execution environment with support for streaming responses, variable substitution, and detailed execution history.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"sl-heading-wrapper level-h2\">\u003Ch2 id=\"accessing-the-playground\">Accessing the Playground\u003C/h2>\u003Ca class=\"sl-anchor-link\" href=\"#accessing-the-playground\">\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sl-anchor-icon\">\u003Csvg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\u003Cpath fill=\"currentcolor\" d=\"m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42Zm8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33ZM8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 1.1.22 1 1 0 0 0 .32-.22l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42Z\">\u003C/path>\u003C/svg>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"sr-only\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\">Section titled “Accessing the Playground”\u003C/span>\u003C/a>\u003C/div>\n\u003Cp>You can access the playground in two ways:\u003C/p>\n\u003Col>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>From the Registry\u003C/strong>: Visit any function’s page and click the “Try It” button\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Direct URL\u003C/strong>: Navigate to \u003Ccode dir=\"auto\">/playground/{author}/{function-name}\u003C/code>\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ol>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"sl-heading-wrapper level-h2\">\u003Ch2 id=\"interface-overview\">Interface Overview\u003C/h2>\u003Ca class=\"sl-anchor-link\" href=\"#interface-overview\">\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sl-anchor-icon\">\u003Csvg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"