\u003C/strong>: Select from pre-configured examples or the function’s default input\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"sl-heading-wrapper level-h3\">\u003Ch3 id=\"output-panel\">Output Panel\u003C/h3>\u003Ca class=\"sl-anchor-link\" href=\"#output-panel\">\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sl-anchor-icon\">\u003Csvg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\u003Cpath fill=\"currentcolor\" d=\"m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42Zm8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33ZM8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 1.1.22 1 1 0 0 0 .32-.22l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42Z\">\u003C/path>\u003C/svg>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"sr-only\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\">Section titled “Output Panel”\u003C/span>\u003C/a>\u003C/div>\n\u003Cp>The output panel displays the execution results:\u003C/p>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Response Tab\u003C/strong>: The function’s returned data\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Headers Tab\u003C/strong>: Response headers (useful for debugging)\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Timeline Tab\u003C/strong>: Execution timeline visualization\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Diff Tab\u003C/strong>: Compare outputs from different executions\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"sl-heading-wrapper level-h3\">\u003Ch3 id=\"sidebar\">Sidebar\u003C/h3>\u003Ca class=\"sl-anchor-link\" href=\"#sidebar\">\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sl-anchor-icon\">\u003Csvg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\u003Cpath fill=\"currentcolor\" d=\"m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42Zm8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a