ured\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Look for retry storms (cascading retries)\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"sl-heading-wrapper level-h3\">\u003Ch3 id=\"limits-not-applying\">Limits not applying\u003C/h3>\u003Ca class=\"sl-anchor-link\" href=\"#limits-not-applying\">\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sl-anchor-icon\">\u003Csvg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\u003Cpath fill=\"currentcolor\" d=\"m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42Zm8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33ZM8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 1.1.22 1 1 0 0 0 .32-.22l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42Z\">\u003C/path>\u003C/svg>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"sr-only\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\">Section titled “Limits not applying”\u003C/span>\u003C/a>\u003C/div>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>Ensure the function.yaml is deployed\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Verify rate_limits section syntax\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Check for conflicting global/function limits\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"sl-heading-wrapper level-h2\">\u003Ch2 id=\"next-steps\">Next Steps\u003C/h2>\u003Ca class=\"sl-anchor-link\" href=\"#next-steps\">\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sl-anchor-icon\">\u003Csvg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\u003Cpath fill=\"currentcolor\" d=\"m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42Zm8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33ZM8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 1.1.22 1 1 0 0 0 .32-.22l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42Z\">\u003C/path>\u003C/svg>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"sr-only\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\">Section titled “Next Steps”\u003C/span>\u003C/a>\u003C/div>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>Learn about \u003Ca href=\"/guides/webhooks/\">webhooks\u003C/a> for event-driven integrations\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Set up \u003Ca href=\"/guides/ci-cd/\">CI/CD pipelines\u003C/a> for automated deployments\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Explore \u003Ca href=\"/analytics/\">monitoring and analytics\u003C/a> for insights\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>",{"headings":2268,"localImagePaths":2338,"remoteImagePaths":2339,"frontmatter":2340,"imagePaths":2342},[2269,2270,2273,2276,2279,2282,2285,2288,2291,2294,2297,2300,2303,2306,2309,2312,2315,2318,2319,2322,2325,2328,2329,2330,2331,2334,2337],{"depth":25,"slug":462,"text":463},{"depth":25,"slug":2271,"text":2272},"rate-limit-types","Rate Limit Types",{"depth":61,"slug":2274,"text":2275},"1-per-function-limits","1. Per-Function Limits",{"depth":61,"slug":2277,"text":2278},"2-per-user-limits","2. Per-User Limits",{"depth":61,"slug":2280,"text":2281},"3-global-limits","3. Global Limits",{"depth":25,"slug":2283,"text":2284},"configuration-options","Configuration Options",{"depth":25,"slug":2286,"text":2287},"rate-limit-headers","Rate Limit Headers",{"depth":61,"slug":2289,"text":2290},"header-descriptions","Header Descriptions",{"depth":25,"slug":2292,"text":2293},"handling-rate-limit-errors","Handling Rate Limit Errors",{"depth":61,"slug":2295,"text":2296},"retry-strategies","Retry Strategies",{"depth":25,"slug":2298,"text":2299},"usage-quotas","Usage Quotas",{"depth":61,"slug":2301,"text":2302},"daily-limits","Daily Limits",{"depth":61,"slug":2304,"text":2305},"monthly-limits","Monthly Limits",{"depth":61,"slug":2307,"text":2308},"custom-time-windows","Custom Time Windows",{"depth":25,"slug":2310,"text":2311},"alerting","Alerting",{"depth":61,"slug":2313,"text":2314},"alert-channels","Alert Channels",{"depth":25,"slug":2316,"text":2317},"plan-limits","Plan Limits",{"depth":25,"slug":1371,"text":1372},{"depth":61,"slug":2320,"text":2321},"path-specific-limits","Path-Specific Limits",{"depth":61,"slug":2323,"text":2324},"method-specific-limits","Method-Specific Limits",{"depth":61,"slug":2326,"text":2327},"ip-based-limits","IP-Based Limits",{"depth":25,"slug":424,"text":425},{"depth":25,"slug":533,"text":534},{"depth":25,"slug":784,"text":785},{"depth":61,"slug":2332,"text":2333},"unexpected-429s","Unexpected 429s",{"depth":61,"slug":2335,"text":2336},"limits-not-applying","Limits not applying",{"depth":25,"slug":290,"text":291},[],[],{"title":1621,"description":2258,"sidebar":2341},{"order":49},[],"guides/registry-guide",{"id":2343,"data":2345,"body":2352,"filePath":2353,"digest":2354,"rendered":2355},{"title":2346,"description":2347,"editUrl":8,"head":2348,"template":10,"sidebar":2349,"pagefind":8,"draft":13},"Registry Guide","Learn how to browse, install, and publish functions in the FunctionFly public registry.",[],{"order":2350,"hidden":13,"attrs":2351},101,{},"The FunctionFly Registry is a public marketplace for serverless functions. Discover, share, and reuse functions built by the community.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\n# Search the registry\nffly search \u003Cquery>\n\n# Install a function\nffly install \u003Cauthor>/\u003Cfunction-name>\n\n# Invoke an installed function\nffly run \u003Cauthor>/\u003Cfunction-name> --data '{\"key\": \"value\"}'\n```\n\n## Key Features\n\n- **Discover**: Browse thousands of community-built functions\n- **Install**: Add registry functions to your projects with one command\n- **Publish**: Share your functions with the community\n- **Trust Scores**: Evaluate function quality and security\n\n## Browsing\n\nVisit [functionfly.com/registry](https://functionfly.com/registry) to:\n- Search by name, description, or tags\n- Filter by runtime (Python, JavaScript, Go, etc.)\n- Sort by popularity, trust score, or recently added\n- View documentation and source code\n\n## Installing Functions\n\n```bash\n# Install latest version\nffly install \u003Cauthor>/\u003Cfunction-name>\n\n# Install specific version\nffly install \u003Cauthor>/\u003Cfunction-name>@1.2.0\n\n# Install to specific directory\nffly install \u003Cauthor>/\u003Cfunction-name> --dir ./my-functions/\n```\n\n## Using Installed Functions\n\n```bash\n# Invoke from CLI\nffly run \u003Cfunction-name> --data '{\"key\": \"value\"}'\n```\n\nOr in code:\n\n```javascript\nimport { invoke } from '@functionfly/sdk';\n\nconst result = await invoke('author/function-name', {\n  name: 'FunctionFly'\n});\n```\n\n## Testing in Playground\n\nBefore invoking via code, test functions in the Playground at `/playground/{author}/{function-name}`.\n\n## Publishing Functions\n\n```bash\n# Prepare for publishing\nffly publish --dry-run\n\n# Publish\nffly publish\n\n# Version with semantic versioning\nffly publish --bump patch  # bug fixes\nffly publish --bump minor  # new features\nffly publish --bump major # breaking changes\n```\n\nRequirements:\n- Passes security scanning\n- Includes documentation (README.md)\n- Valid function.yaml configuration\n\n## Trust Scores\n\nFunctions are rated 0-100% based on:\n- **Code Quality**: Static analysis and security scanning\n- **Documentation**: Completeness of README and examples\n- **Maintenance**: Update frequency and issue response\n- **Usage**: Number of installs and success rate\n- **Verification**: Author identity and domain verification\n\nUse functions with scores above 70% for production workloads.\n\n## Managing Published Functions\n\n```bash\n# List your functions\nffly list --mine\n\n# Update\nffly update \u003Cfunction-name>\n\n# Deprecate\nffly deprecate \u003Cfunction-name>\n```\n\n## Next Steps\n\n- [Secrets Vault](/secrets-vault/) - Securely manage sensitive configuration\n- [Authentication](/guides/authentication/) - Secure your functions\n- [CI/CD Integration](/guides/ci-cd/) - Automate deployments","src/content/docs/guides/registry-guide.md","01065f68cf5aa5af",{"html":2356,"metadata