style=\"--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0\">--bump\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53\"> \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#ECC48D;--1:#3B61B0\">minor\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53\">  \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#919F9F;--1:#5F636F\"># new features\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"ec-line\">\u003Cdiv class=\"code\">\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0\">ffly\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53\"> \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#ECC48D;--1:#3B61B0\">publish\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53\"> \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#82AAFF;--1:#3B61B0\">--bump\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53\"> \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#ECC48D;--1:#3B61B0\">major\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#D6DEEB;--1:#403F53\"> \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--0:#919F9F;--1:#5F636F\"># breaking changes\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\u003Cdiv class=\"copy\">\u003Cdiv aria-live=\"polite\">\u003C/div>\u003Cbutton title=\"Copy to clipboard\" data-copied=\"Copied!\" data-code=\"ffly publish --dry-runffly publishffly publish --bump patch  # bug fixesffly publish --bump minor  # new featuresffly publish --bump major # breaking changes\">\u003Cdiv>\u003C/div>\u003C/button>\u003C/div>\u003C/figure>\u003C/div>\n\u003Cp>Requirements:\u003C/p>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>Passes security scanning\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Includes documentation (README.md)\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Valid function.yaml configuration\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"sl-heading-wrapper level-h2\">\u003Ch2 id=\"trust-scores\">Trust Scores\u003C/h2>\u003Ca class=\"sl-anchor-link\" href=\"#trust-scores\">\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sl-anchor-icon\">\u003Csvg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\u003Cpath fill=\"currentcolor\" d=\"m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0