003Cstrong>Bookmark environments\u003C/strong> - Save \u003Ccode dir=\"auto\">/studio/staging\u003C/code> as a bookmark\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Check the URL\u003C/strong> - Always confirm which environment you’re in\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>",{"headings":2538,"localImagePaths":2585,"remoteImagePaths":2586,"frontmatter":2587,"imagePaths":2589},[2539,2542,2545,2548,2551,2554,2557,2560,2563,2564,2567,2570,2573,2576,2579,2582],{"depth":12,"slug":2540,"text":2541},"functionfly-studio","FunctionFly Studio",{"depth":25,"slug":2543,"text":2544},"accessing-studio","Accessing Studio",{"depth":25,"slug":2546,"text":2547},"environment-tabs","Environment Tabs",{"depth":61,"slug":2549,"text":2550},"how-environment-switching-works","How Environment Switching Works",{"depth":25,"slug":2552,"text":2553},"studio-layout","Studio Layout",{"depth":61,"slug":2555,"text":2556},"left-panel-tabs","Left Panel Tabs",{"depth":61,"slug":2558,"text":2559},"bottom-panel-tabs","Bottom Panel Tabs",{"depth":61,"slug":2561,"text":2562},"right-panel-tabs","Right Panel Tabs",{"depth":25,"slug":465,"text":466},{"depth":61,"slug":2565,"text":2566},"agent-management","Agent Management",{"depth":61,"slug":2568,"text":2569},"workflow-canvas","Workflow Canvas",{"depth":61,"slug":2571,"text":2572},"ghost-mode","Ghost Mode",{"depth":61,"slug":2574,"text":2575},"marketplace","Marketplace",{"depth":25,"slug":2577,"text":2578},"api-integration","API Integration",{"depth":61,"slug":2580,"text":2581},"key-endpoints","Key Endpoints",{"depth":25,"slug":2583,"text":2584},"tips","Tips",[],[],{"title":2527,"description":2528,"sidebar":2588},{"order":12},[],"guides/vercel",{"id":2590,"data":2592,"body":2598,"filePath":2599,"digest":2600,"rendered":2601},{"title":2593,"description":2594,"editUrl":8,"head":2595,"template":10,"sidebar":2596,"pagefind":8,"draft":13},"Vercel","Deploy FunctionFly functions to Vercel Edge Functions",[],{"hidden":13,"attrs":2597},{},"# Vercel\n\nDeploy your FunctionFly functions to [Vercel Edge Functions](https://vercel.com/docs/concepts/functions/edge-functions) for ultra-low latency global distribution.\n\n## Features\n\n- **Global edge network** - 100+ PoPs worldwide\n- **\u003C50ms cold start** - Near-instant execution\n- **Automatic scaling** - Handles any traffic load\n- **Edge middleware** - Modify requests/responses\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Vercel account with Edge Functions enabled\n- Vercel CLI installed: `npm i -g vercel`\n\n## Configuration\n\n```jsonc\n// functionfly.jsonc\n{\n  \"provider\": \"vercel\",\n  \"provider_config\": {\n    \"framework\": \"nextjs\",  // or \"svelte\", \"remix\", \"other\"\n    \"regions\": [\"iad1\", \"sfo1\", \"cdg1\"]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Deployment\n\n```bash\n# Deploy to Vercel\nffly deploy --provider vercel\n\n# Deploy to specific region\nffly deploy --provider vercel --region iad1\n```\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n```bash\n# Set Vercel tokens\nffly env set VERCEL_TOKEN=your_token --provider vercel\nffly env set VERCEL_ORG_ID=your_org --provider vercel\nffly env set VERCEL_PROJECT_ID=your_project --provider vercel\n```\n\n## Routes\n\nVercel Edge Functions use a `/api/edge/*` route pattern. FunctionFly functions are automatically mapped to edge functions.\n\n## Limitations\n\n- Maximum 3008MB memory\n- Maximum 30 second timeout\n- No WebSocket support\n- Limited filesystem access","src/content/docs/guides/vercel.md","55254b2903c0def7",{"html":2602,"metadata":2603},"\u003Cdiv class=\"sl-heading-wrapper level-h1\">\u003Ch1 id=\"vercel\">Vercel\u003C/h1>\u003Ca class=\"sl-anchor-link\" href=\"#vercel\">\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sl-anchor-icon\">\u003Csvg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\u003Cpath fill=\"currentcolor\" d=\"m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42Zm8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5