={bool}&#x26;category={name}\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\u003Cdiv class=\"copy\">\u003Cdiv aria-live=\"polite\">\u003C/div>\u003Cbutton title=\"Copy to clipboard\" data-copied=\"Copied!\" data-code=\"GET /v1/registry/functions?trust_score_min={threshold}&#x26;verified={bool}&#x26;category={name}\">\u003Cdiv>\u003C/div>\u003C/button>\u003C/div>\u003C/figure>\u003C/div>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Trust-Aware Discovery Algorithm\u003C/strong>:\u003C/p>\n\u003Col>\n\u003Cli>Query registry with minimum trust threshold\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Sort by composite score: \u003Ccode dir=\"auto\">(trust_score × 0.7) + (popularity × 0.3)\u003C/code>\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Filter by verification level if required by policy\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Return ranked list with trust metadata\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ol>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"sl-heading-wrapper level-h3\">\u003Ch3 id=\"42-trust-evaluation-flow\">4.2 Trust Evaluation Flow\u003C/h3>\u003Ca class=\"sl-anchor-link\" href=\"#42-trust-evaluation-flow\">\u003Cspan aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sl-anchor-icon\">\u003Csvg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\u003Cpath fill=\"currentcolor\" d=\"m12.11 15.39-3.88 3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1-3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0-3.5l3.88-3.88a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-3.88 3.89a4.48 4.48 0 0 0 6.33 6.33l3.89-3.88a1 1 0 1 0-1.42-1.42Zm8.58-12.08a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-6.33 0l-3.89 3.88a1 1 0 0 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.88a2.52 2.52 0 0 1 3.5 0 2.47 2.47 0 0 1 0 3.5l-3.88 3.88a1 1 0 1 0 1.42 1.42l3.88-3.89a4.49 4.49 0 0 0 0-6.33ZM8.83 15.17a1 1 0 0 0 1.1.22 1 1 0 0 0 .32-.22l4.92-4.92a1 1 0 0 0-1.42-1.42l-4.92 4.92a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42Z\">\u003C/path>\u003C/svg>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"sr-only\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\">Section titled “4.2 Trust Evaluation Flow”\u003C/span>\u003C/a>\u003C/div>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"expressive-code\">\u003Cfigure class=\"frame not-content\">\u003Cfigcaption class=\"header\">\u003C/figcaption>\u003Cpre data-language=\"plaintext\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cdiv class=\"ec-line\">\u003Cdiv